WemRes
/ww*
/*/Ww*
!/WemLabeler/
*.json
# odradek's RTTI type schema (verbatim copy of odradek-game-ds2/src/main/resources/types.json).
# NOT generated by any build step: it is odradek's own checked-in resource, and the reader
# cannot decode a single byte without it (every class's fields/offsets live here).
# Must be in the repo; git stores it deflated at ~1MB even though it is 8.2MB on disk.
!OdradekSharp/Data/*.json
_anal*
*txtp
*csv
*.xml
*.log
WemLabeler/bin/
WemLabeler/obj/
OdradekSharp/bin/
OdradekSharp/obj/
*pyc
utils/
!utils/two_repos.txt
dsh-coding-preset/
/script.*
